{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>For He will judge</b> — as He judged His people at the hand of Pharaoh." "<b>And have compassion on His servants</b> — by way of parable. And when HaShem takes the judgment of His people from the hand of the nations, their idols will not save them, like the gods of Egypt, upon whom HaShem executed judgments."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 135, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:45.801688480Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}